{
  "title": "Juicy Spanish Chickpeas Tarta De Santiago",
  "description": "A cultured and energizing Spanish dish featuring harissa spice, this tarta de santiago is a macrobiotic friendly option, made with sauteed chickpeas and spices, served in a salt block vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
